/T (e-Novia is a deep-tech industrial group engaged in 3D design software and Product Lifecycle Management \(PLM\) solutions for various industries such as aerospace, automotive, machinery and electronics, providing software system services as well as technical support.  The company operates by placing itself between the academy and the industry, promoting ethical and sustainable innovation, helping organisations in different sectors to turn market opportunities into market advantages.)
/E (e-Novia is a deep-tech industrial group engaged in 3D design software and Product Lifecycle Management \(PLM\) solutions for various industries such as aerospace, automotive, machinery and electronics, providing software system services as well as technical support.  The company operates by placing itself between the academy and the industry, promoting ethical and sustainable innovation, helping organisations in different sectors to turn market opportunities into market advantages.)
