<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Introducing AQUASENSE, an innovative system designed to revolutionise your home water filtration. At the heart of this solution is a differential pressure sensor embedded within your carafe, seamlessly connected to an NFC tag. This cutting-edge technology monitors the effectiveness of your water filter.)
/E (Introducing AQUASENSE, an innovative system designed to revolutionise your home water filtration. At the heart of this solution is a differential pressure sensor embedded within your carafe, seamlessly connected to an NFC tag. This cutting-edge technology monitors the effectiveness of your water filter.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
765 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (With just a quick scan of the NFC tag using your smartphone and our user-friendly app, you gain instant access to information about the filter's status. But that's not all - the app harnesses the power of a predictive algorithm to provide personalised advice, ensuring you always enjoy the purest water possible. Say goodbye to guesswork and hello to effortless, smart water filtration with AQUASENSE.)
/E (With just a quick scan of the NFC tag using your smartphone and our user-friendly app, you gain instant access to information about the filter's status. But that's not all - the app harnesses the power of a predictive algorithm to provide personalised advice, ensuring you always enjoy the purest water possible. Say goodbye to guesswork and hello to effortless, smart water filtration with AQUASENSE.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
