802 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The innovation of meaning in the AQUASENSE lies in its ability to transcend the conventional approach of filter management based on average usage.  The system reinterprets this process, giving it new meaning through personalization and precision. This redefined approach, not only optimises performance and user satisfaction, but also fosters a deeper connection between the product and the consumer: the jug is no longer just a container but an intelligent partner in health and wellness, embodying a significant advancement in the meaning and value of home water purification.)
/E (The innovation of meaning in the AQUASENSE lies in its ability to transcend the conventional approach of filter management based on average usage.  The system reinterprets this process, giving it new meaning through personalization and precision. This redefined approach, not only optimises performance and user satisfaction, but also fosters a deeper connection between the product and the consumer: the jug is no longer just a container but an intelligent partner in health and wellness, embodying a significant advancement in the meaning and value of home water purification.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
