/S /H2
/T (The Leadership Story has been the starting point of our journey, full of excitement and willingness to face the challenge. Everyone found the assignment very interesting and for this reason, despite the busy schedules and the difficulty in organising physical meetings, there has been commitment and participation by each member.  We reached a good level of communication through online reviews and briefings, also the workload has been splitted in a proper way: even if some of us managed the contacts with the interviewed, others handled the content part and, finally, some others the design one, the constant progress of the project was clear to everyone leading to a deep satisfaction of the work submitted.)
